Authorship of the files in this package
=======================================

All R code, the kernel scripts under app/kernel, the notebook page under app,
and the Quarto extension under quarto/_extensions/carmar are written by
Mohammed Saqr and licensed under the MIT license (see LICENSE).

The notebook page (app/carmar_V<version>.html) is a single self-contained
file built from two JavaScript sources, both by the same author:

  component            version   license   copyright holder
  -------------------  --------  --------  -----------------
  CarmaR (this tree)   <pkg>     MIT       Mohammed Saqr
  @carmnote/core       0.5.0     MIT       Mohammed Saqr

No third-party JavaScript library is bundled into the page or into the
extension's carmar-publish.js. This was verified at packaging time by
inspecting the bundle for library banners and API surfaces: the build's only
runtime dependency is @carmnote/core, whose own dependencies are build tools
(esbuild, vite, html-minifier-terser) that leave nothing in the output.

Resources the page can fetch at runtime, on the user's request, are NOT part
of this package and are listed here only for completeness:

  en_US spelling data     SCOWL (Kevin Atkinson), via the dictionary-en 4.0.0
                          npm package, fetched from cdn.jsdelivr.net when the
                          user turns spell checking on.
  @mlc-ai/web-llm 0.2.84  Apache-2.0, fetched from cdn.jsdelivr.net when the
                          user chooses the in-browser (WebGPU) AI provider.
